                {
                  "id": "_56nbtha2r",
                  "title": "View a Workspace",
                  "link": "https://www.greenshadesonline.com/internal/Workspaces.aspx",
                  "desc": "<div>This tools allows you to access and/or search for a workspace.</div><div><br></div><div>A workspace can be accessed by entering the&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14.08px;\">Workspace ID (WSID)</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.88rem;\">, along with the reason for accessing the workspace and selecting continue. If the user has permission, the user will be redirected to the client&#39;s workspace as a super administrator.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.88rem;\"><br></span></div><div>A workspace can all be accessed by searching based off a number of options and selecting the Access button. When selecting access, the user will be redirected to a page requesting the reason for&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14.08px;\">accessing the workspace before selecting continue.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.08px;\">If the user has permission, the user will be then redirected to the client&#39;s workspace as a super administrator.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14.08px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14.08px;\">Outside of accessing a workspace, this page can also provide useful information and allow users to View Details for a workspace entered in the search bar. These details include active modules, check count per check date, as well as a list of admins.</span></div>",
                  "demoLink": "",
                  "config": "",
                  "inProgress": false,
                  "hiddenFields": [
                    "demo",
                    "config",
                    "kb"
                  ],
                  "kbArticles": [],
                  "lastUpdated": "04/27/2026, 06:49:32 PM"
